--- js-template/.github/codeql/codeql-config.yml
+++ .github/codeql/codeql-config.yml
@@ -1,4 +1,16 @@
-name: Shipped code and pipeline scripts
+name: Shipped code, tests and pipeline scripts
+# Analyse what this repository runs and ships. The ignored trees are evidence
+# and scratch code, never executed by the package or by CI (issue #216):
+# - docs/case-studies: verbatim archived copies of other repositories' files,
+#   kept as evidence; a fix here would falsify the record. They held 6 of the
+#   26 open alerts. zizmor skips them for the same reason (workflows.yml).
+# - dev/log: collected CI logs and analysis for issues and pull requests.
+# - experiments, js/experiments: one-off reproduction and debug scripts, as in
+#   both pipeline templates' CodeQL configuration.
+# js/examples stays analysed, unlike in the JavaScript template: the npm package
+# ships it (js/package.json `files`), so users run and copy those scripts.
 paths-ignore:
+  - docs/case-studies
+  - dev/log
   - experiments
-  - examples
+  - js/experiments
